<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">

<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Wedlock Account Activation</title>
    <style>
        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        @font-face {
            font-family: "Proxima Nova Regular";
            src: url('../public/font/Proxima-Nova-Regular.otf') format("opentype");
        }

        @font-face {
            font-family: "Proxima Nova Thin";
            src: url('../public/font/Proxima-Nova-Thin.otf') format("opentype");
        }

        body {
            font-family: "Proxima Nova Regular", sans-serif;
            background-color: #F4F4F4;
            display: flex;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            min-height: 100vh;
            padding: 1rem;
        }

        

        .container {
            width: 100%;
            height: 100vh;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
        }

        .logo img {
            width: 200px;
            height: auto;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        #title {
            font-size: 18px;
            font-weight: 400;
            color: #4D4D4D;
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        #name {
            color: black;
            font-weight: 600;
        }

        .content h3 {
            margin-top: 1rem;
            margin-bottom: 1rem;
            color: #007EAF;
            font-size: 28px;
            font-weight: 700;
            line-height: 36px;
        }

        .content p {
            font-size: 16px;
            color: #4D4D4D;
            line-height: 24px;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }

        .otp {
            display: flex;
            justify-content: left;
            gap: 10px;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
        }

        .otp div {
            font-size: 64px;
            font-weight: 800;
            color: #007EAF;
            padding: 0 28px 0 28px;
            border: 2px solid #53ADAE;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }
        #char{
            margin-right: 10px;
        }


        .footer {
            font-size: 14px;
            color: #666;
            margin-top: 20px;
        }

        .footer a {
            color: #4D4D4D;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-weight: 500;
        }

        @media (max-width: 480px) {

            .container {
                padding: 1.5rem;
            }
            #char{
            margin-right: 5px;
          }

            .content h3 {
                font-size: 24px;
                line-height: 32px;
            }

            .otp div {
                display: flex;
                justify-content: center;
                align-items: center;
                gap: 5px;
                font-size: 28px;
                padding: 8px 12px;

            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>
    <div class="container">
        <div class="logo">
            <a href="https://www.wedlock.au">
                <img src="https://wedlock.au/newlogo.png" alt="Wedlock Logo">
            </a>
        </div>
        <div class="content">
            <h2 id="title">Hello <span id="name"><%= name %></span></h2>
            <h3>Forgot Password?</h3>
            <p>It happens to the best of us! If you've forgotten your password for Wedlock, no worries. We're here to help you reset it.</p>
            <p><strong>To reset your password, please use the following recovery code:</strong></p>
            <div class="otp">
                <% activationCode.split('').forEach((char) => { %>
                    <div id="char"><%= char %></div>
                <% }) %>
            </div>
            <p>Click the link below to enter the code and set up a new password:</p>
            <p><a href="https://www.wedlock.au/verify-otp">Reset Password</a></p>
        </div>
        <div class="footer">
            <p>The Wedlock Team</p>
            <p><a href="https://www.wedlock.au">https://www.wedlock.au</a></p>
            <p>Copyright © 2025 Wedlock</p>
        </div>
    </div>
</body>

</html>
